Subject: [PATCH 07/41] Clip mode: show the Loopy violet as violet on the pads.

The violet group of APC40_RGB (velocities 48-51) now has red = 0.6 x blue.
Reason: the protocol values (for example 0x5400FF) have little red, and the WS2812 pads showed them as blue.
The ratio 0.6 comes from the Live violet 0x886CE4 at velocity 80 in the APC40 mkII protocol v1.2.
The other 124 palette entries do not change.
tests/smk_apc40_test.py makes sure that the pad hue of velocities 48-51 is violet and that blue and magenta do not change.
BEHAVIOR.md CLP-13 gives the exception.
