 Start, a hit goes to the first step.

seq_rec_step gives the step that a live hit records on.
If the part did not play its first step since PLAY or Start, it gives the first step (the last step for a reverse 303 line).
Else it gives the step that plays, as before.
rec_step in ui.c uses seq_rec_step for the drums and the 303s.
Reason: after a Start with the external clock already running, a hit before the first tick went to the step of the last run.
