Outside clip mode, a PLAY press sends note on 0x5B and the release sends note off, and X0X starts or stops.
In clip mode, PLAY sends only the APC PLAY note, one time, and X0X does not start.
HOME + PLAY sends no note.
A change of clip mode between the press and the release gives one note off only.
---
